  "citation": "Gornitz V M; White T W (1994): A Coastal Hazards Data Base for the U.S. Gulf Coast (1993) (NDP-04bB). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/SSR.NDP043B",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
